        {
          "ruleId": "bug",
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "z-index 200 puts the menu-toggle below both the mobile sidebar-overlay (999) and the mobile sidebar (1000). When the sidebar is opened on mobile, the full-screen overlay covers the menu-toggle, making it unclickable. Either raise menu-toggle to \u003e= 1001, or accept overlay-click-to-close as the only close mechanism (and document it). Also note this conflicts with the topbar at z-index 90 being on top of the sidebar."
          },
          "locations": [
