        {
          "ruleId": "bug",
          "level": "note",
          "message": {
            "text": "The topbar (z-index 90) sits below the sidebar (z-index 100). On mobile the topbar's `left` collapses to 0, so when the sidebar opens over it, the topbar visually disappears behind the sidebar. The topbar should sit above the sidebar (z-index \u003e= 1000 to match mobile sidebar) so it remains visible/clickable, or the sidebar should be capped below the topbar."
