          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "Interactive elements (nav-link, topbar-icon-btn, action-pill, modal-close, chat-close, toast-close, profile-picture-edit, account-card-copy) define only `:hover` styles, with no `:focus` / `:focus-visible` rules. Keyboard and screen-reader users get no visible focus indicator — a clear accessibility regression. Add at least an outline or background change on focus."
