            "text": "The variable `--admin-primary-dark` is referenced here but is never defined in the `:root` block of this stylesheet. When the global theme doesn't provide it, the hover background silently falls back to nothing (effectively transparent), making the primary CTA lose its hover affordance. Either define it in `:root` (e.g. `--admin-primary-dark: #0056b3;`) or use an existing variable such as a darkened `--admin-primary`."
