                        "text": "/* Move to HTML:\n\u003clink rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\"\u003e\n\u003clink rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin\u003e\n\u003clink rel=\"stylesheet\"\n      href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;700\u0026family=Outfit:wght@400;600\u0026family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600\u0026display=swap\"\u003e\n*/"
