          "ruleId": "performance",
          "level": "note",
          "message": {
            "text": "`transition: all` causes the browser to watch every animatable property on hover/focus/active, leading to unnecessary style invalidation and occasional jank on `box-shadow` / `transform` compositing. List the properties that actually change (background, border-color, color, transform, box-shadow)."
