        {
          "ruleId": "bug",
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "The shared form-input selector omits `input[type=\"search\"]`, `input[type=\"tel\"]`, `input[type=\"date\"]`, `input[type=\"time\"]`, `input[type=\"datetime-local\"]`, `input[type=\"file\"]`, and `input[type=\"color\"]`. For a banking app, search and date inputs are realistic; those will fall back to UA defaults and visually break the design. Add them to the selector list (or use `input:not([type=\"checkbox\"]):not([type=\"radio\"]):not([type=\"file\"]):not([type=\"color\"])` if a single rule is preferred)."
