            "text": "The pre-render theme bootstrap is an inline `\u003cscript\u003e` with no nonce. If a Content Security Policy is configured (recommended for an auth page), `script-src` without `'unsafe-inline'` will block this and break the theme. Either ship this as an external file (e.g., `theme.js` loaded first in `\u003chead\u003e`) or add a CSP nonce/hash. Also verify no sensitive auth data is read from `localStorage` here — the current `vb-theme` key is benign, but this pattern should be reviewed whenever it changes."
          },
