          "message": {
            "text": "Form is missing `method` and `action` attributes. Because submission is delegated to `merchant.js`, if JavaScript fails to load, is blocked, or is tampered with, the browser will fall back to a `GET` request to the current URL — sending the merchant password as a query string parameter and likely hitting the wrong route (returning the page HTML instead of creating the account). Always set explicit `method=\"post\"` and `action=\"...\"` so the form degrades to a server-handled POST submission."
