          "ruleId": "security",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "CSRF protection missing on a state-changing endpoint. The form posts username, reset PIN, and a new password to /api/v3/reset-password with no CSRF token, no custom header challenge, and no evidence of SameSite cookie enforcement. A malicious page can drive the victim's browser to perform an attacker-chosen password reset. Add a CSRF token (hidden input + header echo or a SameSite=Strict session cookie) on the server and include it in the fetch request."
