            "text": "Reset PIN exposed as `type=\"text\"`. As a 4-digit PIN (only 10,000 possibilities), it should be treated as a secret: use `type=\"password\"` so it is masked, excluded from autofill, and not stored in plain-text form caches. Also add `autocomplete=\"off\"` (and `inputmode=\"numeric\"` for mobile UX). Server-side rate limiting is still mandatory, but this is a cheap defense-in-depth fix."
