        {
          "ruleId": "security",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "renderMerchantPayments renders the full card_number (payment.card_number) in the payments table. Storing/displaying full PANs in the merchant dashboard is a serious PCI-DSS issue (Req. 3.4 / 4.x) and increases fraud risk if the page is XSSed. Mask all but the last 4 digits (e.g. `**** **** **** 1111`) and never render the raw PAN; better still, don't request/return it from the API."
          },
