          "ruleId": "bug",
          "level": "warning",
          "message": {
            "text": "Removal race: `dismissToast` relies on an `animationend` event, but if the `.toast-removing` class has no CSS animation (or animation fails to start), the toast is never removed from the DOM, leaking elements and listeners. Add a fallback timeout (e.g. `setTimeout(..., 300)`) that calls `toast.remove()` if `animationend` hasn't fired."
