          "ruleId": "bug",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "The `until pg_isready` loop has no max-attempts/timeout, so a misconfigured or unreachable database causes the container to hang forever instead of failing fast. Add a counter and/or a wall-clock deadline so the container restarts and surfaces the problem."
