        {
          "ruleId": "security",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "DB_USER defaults to the `postgres` superuser. Falling back silently to a superuser connection (and hard-coding a default DB name) creates a path-of-least-resistance security issue. Refuse to default to superuser, require an explicit, least-privileged role via env vars, and avoid committing a default DB name."
