          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "Cache entry is bound to a single commit hash (`commit://8db8c9287af34394fce706f67648100d03c24ebb/...`) with no timestamp, no scanned-file content hash, and no schema version. After the file at `tests/test_merchant_payments.py` is modified in a later commit, ggshield has no reliable way to know the cache is stale and may silently suppress a real new finding (or, conversely, fail to suppress a legitimate re-occurrence). Add `timestamp`, `file_hash`, and a `schema_version` field so the cache can self-invalidate."
          },
